(3259, 115, 'simpler_way_text', 'Starting a college on your own, involves navigating regulatory friction, designing curriculum architectures, setting up IT systems and spending years building public trust. UGC delivers a ready-made education system so you can skip years of trial and error and open with credibility from day one.'),
