(3278, 115, '_why_heading', 'field_home_why_heading'),
(3279, 115, 'why_text_1', 'Families across Multan, Bahawalpur and Dera Ghazi Khan divisions, want quality college education close to home and are willing to pay for it. Yet many towns still lack a trusted name to turn to. A UGC campus meets that demand, earns tuition income over time and creates an enduring legacy in your community.\r\n'),
(3280, 115, '_why_text_1', 'field_home_why_text_1'),
(3281, 115, 'why_text_2', 'Partnering now means joining an established brand while the network is still young and securing your city before someone else does.\r\n'),
