(4203, 133, 'intro_heading', 'A College Franchise <span class=\"text_accent\">Opportunity Built</span> for Potential Investors'),
(4204, 133, '_intro_heading', 'field_franchise_intro_heading'),
(4205, 133, 'intro_text', 'Education stands as one of Pakistan’s most resilient, highly respected sectors—delivering steady cash flow across economic cycles and deep community influence. UGC enables you to enter this high-demand market without the burden of building an institution from scratch. \r\n'),
